    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can expend a use of your Channel Divinity to cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplShieldofFa]{Shield of Faith} or @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplSpiritualW]{Spiritual Weapon} rather than expending a spell slot. When you cast either spell in this way, the spell doesn't require Concentration. Instead the spell lasts for 1 minute, but it ends early if you cast that spell again, have the Incapacitated condition, or die.</p><section id=\"secret-Aj9Z4ttMu8G9e9Li\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>When casting the spell uncheck the \"Consumption\" checkbox and the \"Concentration\" checkbox.</p></section>",
